          "settings": {
            "review_image": "shopify://shop_images/Mounissa_Soilihi.jpg",
            "content": "<p>\"I'd been trying for a long time to find scents that smell expensive and last a long time, but in vain. This is exactly what I was looking for.\"</p>",
