    "fmx_faq": {
      "type": "fmx-faq",
      "blocks": {
        "collapsible_row_1": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Is this perfumed water?",
            "row_content": "<p>Our fragrances are much more than simple perfumed water. You get a high-quality Eau de Parfum (EdP) with 20% fragrance oils: long-lasting, with strong projection and depth.</p><p>Unlike light body sprays or scented waters, our compositions last up to 12 hours on your skin. So you enjoy an intense, refined scent experience for a fraction of the price of luxury brands.</p>"
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_2": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What does 20% fragrance oils mean?",
            "row_content": "<p>The percentage tells you how much pure fragrance oil is in the product. With us, 20% fragrance oils means:</p><p>✔️ It is an Eau de Parfum (EdP), one of the most intense types of perfume for everyday wear.</p><p>✔️ The high share of fragrance oils makes it last: the scent stays noticeable on the skin for up to 12 hours.</p><p>✔️ Strong projection and depth: the scent unfolds in layers and keeps its full, lasting character.</p><p>For comparison: an Eau de Toilette usually contains 5–15% fragrance oils. With 20% you get an intense, long-lasting, high-quality scent experience at a fair price.</p>"
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_3": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Do the scents smell like the designer fragrances that inspired them?",
            "row_content": "<p>Our fragrances capture the character of well-known designer fragrances. They are inspired interpretations with a ~95% scent match to the original.</p>"
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_4": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How long does the scent last?",
            "row_content": "<p>With 20% fragrance oils, the scent lasts up to 12 hours on the skin. Exactly how long depends on your skin type and how you apply it. It works best sprayed on your pulse points, on clean, moisturised skin.</p>"
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_5": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Are your perfumes vegan and cruelty-free?",
            "row_content": "<p>Yes. Our perfumes are <strong>vegan</strong> and <strong>cruelty-free</strong>.</p>"
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_6": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Can I return the scent if I don't like it?",
            "row_content": "<p>Yes. You have a 60-day money-back guarantee. If you are not completely satisfied, send the product back within 60 days and get your money back.</p>"
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_7": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How long does delivery take?",
            "row_content": "<p>We ship your order within 48 hours, with tracking.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
